<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπερ-είδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drive against,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέρεισε δὲ Παλλὰς Ἀθήνη [ἔγχος]
				νείατον ἐς κενεῶνα</span>
			<i>drove</i> it <i>home,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.856
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.48
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέρεισε δὲ ἶν᾽ ἀπέλεθρον</span>
			<i>put</i> vast strength <i>to</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				7.269
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.538
			</span></i>; <i>thrust</i> a door <i>to, shut</i> it <i>close,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				12.331
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γένειόν τινι</span>
			<i>lean</i> it <i>upon . .,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				5.56
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸν νοῦν</span>
			<i>attend to</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				148.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν διάνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.392b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῷ φιλεῖν ἐμαυτόν</span>
			<i>give</i> oneself <i>up to,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				463c
			</span></i>; <i>direct,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν θεὸν τὸν λόγον</span>
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>rest in</i> or <i>upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαυκάλη ἐπὶ διαγωνίων λίθων
					ἐπηρεισμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.109
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαὶ -όμεναι πνεύματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					2.38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.5.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἄλλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm.Math.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν φάλαγγά τινι</span>
			<i>bring the whole force of</i> the phalanx <i>against,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				8
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοῖς ἀντιτεταγμένοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pyrrh.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				16.13
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				14.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαίφη προτόνοις ἐπερειδομένας</span>
			<i>staying their</i> sails with ropes, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				112
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>lean</i> or <i>bear upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βακτηρίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					277
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				789e
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>lean upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμετέρῃ ἐ. Ἑλλὰς ἐφορμῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.204
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>resist with all one's force,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be leaned on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				9.4.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>to be subject to pressure</i> or <i>impact,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.142
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ χειρὶ ἐπερείδειν</span>
			<i>press heavily</i> with the hand, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
